/* ══════════════════════════════════════════
   guide-content.js — every Help & Guides article, as data (js/guide.js draws them)

   EVERY NEW OR CHANGED FEATURE IS ADDED HERE IN THE SAME STEP (CLAUDE.md › Help & Guides; checklist and
   log: docs/help-guide/README.md).

   MSS_GUIDE_SECTIONS: [id, name, one line, icon]
   MSS_GUIDE: one article each —
     id     unique, short (used in links: Help & Guides › ?guide=<id>)
     s      its section id
     t      the title — a question people would ask, or the feature's name
     what   What is it? (one sentence)       why   Why use it? (one sentence)
     how    How does it work? (short steps)  where Where can I find it? [[label, href], …] (href '' = no link)
     shot   optional: a real screenshot in assets/onboarding/ — '<name>' shows <name>-desktop / -phone
     k      search words people would type   rel   related article ids
══════════════════════════════════════════ */
